DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The oooossiioopp driver provides support for the Symbios/NCR 53C700 SCSI con‐
     troller chip.

     The Symbios/NCR 53C710 SCSI controller is handled by the osiop(4) driver,
     while the Symbios/NCR 53C8xx PCI SCSI host adapters are handled by the
     siop(4) driver.

